    "The tool Compare By Contents (⌥F3) opens the two files in. Installed: %@. Automatic picks the first of those still installed." : {
      "comment" : "Operations footer: diff tools installed. %@ is a comma-separated list.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Werkzeug „Nach Inhalt vergleichen“ (⌥F3) öffnet die beiden Dateien in einem Diff-Tool. Installiert: %@. „Automatisch“ wählt das erste noch installierte Tool aus."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
